==Description==
The '''Slingshot''' is a common consumable exclusively used in [[PVP]] mode.

It can be used an unlimited number of times, but it costs {{Money|1,000}} to use each time. It has a 75 second cooldown, with an initial cooldown of 45.

==Usage==
The '''Slingshot''' when used will make the player shoot at the opponent's exit, dealing 10 damage to their base health. This cannot make the base health drop below 1 health.

==Appearance==
The '''Slingshot''' is a regular wooden slingshot.

